 <body><main class="shell"><header class="topbar"><div class="brand"><div class="brandmark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 4 12 20 20 4l-8 7L4 4Z" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="m9 13 3 6 3-6" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"/></svg></div>NIGHTFALL <span style="color:#82798c">/</span> ARCADE</div><div class="top-right">A CITY UNDER <b>ATTACK</b> &nbsp;·&nbsp; EST. 2025</div></header>
 <section class="screen active" id="gameScreen"><div class="game-layout"><div class="game-frame"><div class="game-head"><div class="game-title">Nightfall: City of the Damned</div><div class="live"><i></i><span id="statusText">STORY MODE</span></div></div><div class="canvas-wrap"><canvas id="game" width="960" height="540" aria-label="Nightfall beat em up game"></canvas><div class="overlay" id="startOverlay"><div class="modal"><div class="eyebrow">A 9-stage arcade brawler</div><h1>THE NIGHT<br>IS HUNGRY.</h1><p>When an ancient vampire wakes beneath the city, twelve unlikely heroes answer the call. Fight through the streets, discover your style, and send the darkness back to its grave.</p><div class="menu-actions"><button class="btn" id="playBtn">CHOOSE YOUR FIGHTER &nbsp; →</button><button class="btn secondary" id="continueBtn" hidden>CONTINUE RUN</button></div></div></div><div class="overlay" id="selectOverlay" hidden><div class="modal select-modal"><div class="select-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">Pick your fighter · 6 available</div><h2>WHO'S UP NEXT?</h2></div><button class="btn secondary" id="closeSelect">✕</button></div><div class="char-grid" id="charGrid"></div><div class="select-bottom"><div class="select-meta" id="charInfo">Choose a fighter to see their style.</div><button class="btn" id="startRun">ENTER THE NIGHT &nbsp; →</button></div></div></div><div class="overlay" id="endOverlay" hidden><div class="modal"><div class="eyebrow" id="endEyebrow">RUN COMPLETE</div><h2 id="endTitle">THE CITY LIVES.</h2><p id="endCopy">The night is over. For now.</p><div class="menu-actions"><button class="btn" id="againBtn">FIGHT AGAIN</button><button class="btn secondary" id="homeBtn">MAIN MENU</button></div></div></div><div class="touch-controls" id="touchControls"><div class="touch-group"><button class="touch-btn" data-key="ArrowLeft">◀</button><button class="touch-btn" data-key="ArrowRight">▶</button><button class="touch-btn" data-key="ArrowUp">▲</button><button class="touch-btn" data-key="ArrowDown">▼</button></div><div class="touch-group"><button class="touch-btn attack" data-key="j">J</button><button class="touch-btn attack" data-key="k">K</button></div></div></div><div class="game-footer"><span class="desktop-tip">MOVE <b class="key">WASD</b> / <b class="key">←↑↓→</b> &nbsp; ATTACK <b class="key">J</b> &nbsp; SPECIAL <b class="key">K</b> &nbsp; PAUSE <b class="key">P</b></span><span class="foot-right" id="footerText">12 FIGHTERS · 9 STAGES</span></div></div><aside class="side"><div class="card mission"><div class="mission-icon">☠</div><div><strong>THE BLOOD MOON</strong><small>Downtown · 9 districts</small></div></div><div class="card story"><div class="card-label">THE STORY</div><h2>One city.<br>One long night.</h2><p>It began with a tremor beneath Old Town. Now <b>Count Vesper</b> and his nightborn army are spilling into the streets. The city has nine districts left before dawn—and twelve fighters willing to stand in their way.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="card-label">YOUR CREW</div><div class="roster-stat"><span>Ready to fight</span><b>06 / 12</b></div><div class="roster-stat"><span>Fighting styles</span><b>12 unique</b></div><div class="roster-stat"><span>Costumes</span><b>36 looks</b></div><div class="roster-stat"><span>Districts</span><b>09 stages</b></div></div></aside></div><div class="controls">A pixel-perfect punch-up for the whole family. <span class="desktop-tip">Use <span class="key">J</span> to strike and <span class="key">K</span> when your special meter glows.</span></div></section></main>
